flowchart TD
    %% Diagram 5b: Activity - Staff Appointment Management
    %% Based on src/app/dashboard/appointments/page.tsx implementation

    Start([Start]) --> A[View All Appointments]
    A --> B[Filter by Status]
    B --> C{Appointment Action}

    C -->|Update Status| D[Change Status:<br/>scheduled / completed / cancelled]
    D --> E[Save Status Update]
    E --> A

    C -->|Edit Appointment| F[Open Edit Appointment Form]
    F --> G[Update Treatment, Date,<br/>Time, Duration]
    G --> H{Slot Conflict?}

    H -->|Yes| I[Show Conflict Error]
    I --> G

    H -->|No| J[Save Changes]
    J --> A

    C -->|Delete Appointment| K[Confirm Deletion]
    K --> L[Delete Appointment Record]
    L --> A

    style Start fill:#e1f5e1,stroke:#059669,stroke-width:2px
    style C fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,stroke-width:1px
    style H fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,stroke-width:1px